{"kind": "mod", "id": 1477, "name": "AutoRun", "slug": "autorun", "teaser": "Just keep running.", "owner_name": "Tyfon", "downloads": 7594, "favourites": 9, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.tyfon.autorun", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T16:36:05.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-10T04:05:30.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-10T04:05:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "6.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Adds a keybind that makes you auto-run!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Default is Ctrl-W, bindable in the F12 menu.</li>\n<li>Cancels automatically when you press your normal forward or backward keys.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Like almost every mod here, extract the 7z archive into your SPT directory.</p>\n<p>You need <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7zip</a> to extract and install this mod.</p>\n<p>Example (thanks DrakiaXYZ for the gif)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Uninstallation</h3>\n<p>To uninstall, simply delete <strong>Tyfon.AutoRun.dll</strong> from <strong>&lt;your SPT folder&gt;/BepInEx/plugins</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Troubleshooting</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Q: How do I change the keybind?</strong></p>\n<p>A: Press F12 to bring up the client mod configuration menu, expand Tyfon.AutoRun, click the keybind and press whatever you want.</p>\n<p><strong>Q: I found a bug!</strong></p>\n<p>A: Open an <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/tyfon7/AutoRun/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">issue</a> or make a comment here. Please include logs if possible!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/tyfon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a> ☕</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1398, "published_at": "2024-07-07T05:10:20.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1477/autorun/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1023, "published_at": "2024-11-26T19:41:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1477/autorun/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "4.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1608, "published_at": "2025-03-16T04:05:01.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1477/autorun/4.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "5.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 4833, "downloads": 2581, "published_at": "2025-10-17T09:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1477/autorun/5.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "6.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 4818, "downloads": 37, "published_at": 